&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You would own Mews&#39; relationships with the press, turning company news, product launches and leadership insight into credible coverage across hospitality, travel, technology and business media. This is a new role, the first dedicated media relations seat at Mews, so the contacts you build and the way you work will set the standard for how we deal with the press. Hospitality technology offers good stories and unusual data to pitch, and leaders here respond to press requests within about a day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You would join the Communications team within Marketing and work closely with the communications lead, the colleagues who shape our stories, and leadership, product marketing and regional marketing. Day to day you would pitch journalists directly, host press briefings, handle inbound enquiries and prepare leaders to speak well in front of the press. The role is remote first in Europe, ideally near London, Berlin or Paris where many of the journalists we work with are based, with about 10% travel to meet press and attend events such as Unfold.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Journalists respond to people they know and trust, not to mass pitches, and the strongest coverage comes from a specialist who holds those relationships personally. Mews has strong stories and data to offer, and this role exists so that someone owns that conversation: choosing the right journalist for each story, answering inbound questions quickly and accurately, and knowing when to escalate something sensitive. Done well, it builds the company&#39;s reputation with the people who cover our industry over the long term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain direct relationships with journalists across hospitality, travel, technology and business media: develop stories with the communications team, pitch them proactively by phone and email, host press briefings and invite journalists to events such as Unfold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to inbound press enquiries (currently two to three a week and growing) quickly and accurately, and escalate anything potentially sensitive to the communications lead straight away.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief and coach executive and local spokespeople, and share what you learn from journalists with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redesign how media monitoring, journalist research and coverage reporting work using AI, and set the workflows up so the rest of the team can use them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and improve the team&#39;s media management tool, and check every AI-assisted pitch, briefing or summary before it reaches a journalist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role that means you have gone well beyond using AI to draft copy. You have redesigned parts of how media relations work gets done, such as monitoring, journalist research or coverage reporting, you have built approaches that colleagues now follow, and you actively question and check what AI gives you, including target lists, summaries and quotes, before anything reaches a journalist or a spokesperson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seven to ten years in PR and communications with depth in B2B media relations, including time in a PR agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your own journalist contacts and hands-on experience pitching by phone, email and in person, with fully fluent English, written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of handling reactive and sensitive press enquiries under time pressure, with clear habits about when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence preparing senior and non-expert spokespeople for press conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Fluency Level 3 or the equivalent hands-on experience, shown through tools or workflows you have built for media relations work, not only content you have written with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French or German alongside fluent English, or existing relationships with journalists in the UK, France, Germany or the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with B2B technology clients or in hospitality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring coverage and coordinating local expertise in markets where you have fewer contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€71.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€93.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SENIOR SOFTWARE ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is building the future of sports performance technology, with a mission to &lt;strong&gt;Unleash the Potential&lt;/strong&gt; of every athlete and team on earth. We don&#39;t just work in the sporting industry; we are actively changing it.&amp;nbsp; Since 2006, our solutions have been leading the way in sports performance software, science, and data, in a world where 1% can literally mean the difference between winning and losing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with over 5,800 teams around the world, empowering coaches, managers and trainers in premier teams in the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, EPL, AFL, NRL, NCAA and more. We provide the information they need to optimize athletes’ health, game-day readiness, and performance, as well as in-game tactics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a sports technology company that empowers professional teams to make data-driven decisions. We deliver health, performance, video, and AI insights from the locker room to competitive environments, ensuring every decision is an opportunity to gain an advantage, sharpen performance, and build lasting success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SOLVING HARD PROBLEMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help build the Perch camera system,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Europe (remote), you will work across platform, perception, and ML systems. You will help us improve how we collect, process, and analyze performance data at scale, spanning from devices collecting real-time to backend services and ML infrastructure. All of which will have a direct impact on customers and their experiences with the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits a strong generalist who has seen many parts of engineering. You might have worked on any of the following: high-throughput systems, computer vision, robotics, ML infrastructure, or other complex applications. Our ideal candidate brings strong engineering judgment, good technical range, and the ability to learn quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be hands-on, working in Python and C++ on devices and services in use by our customers every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and implement algorithms for 3D object tracking, segmentation, and motion recognition on embedded hardware.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Train and iterate on ML models — from dataset curation through training, evaluation, and deployment to edge devices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Help bring ML, computer vision, or signal-processing systems into production with tight performance constraints&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build reliable application features and services that customers use in real environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analyze production data to find system limits, product issues, and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate closely with the embedded platform team on model optimization and inference performance, and with the applications team on how tracking data becomes product features.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;4+ years of software engineering experience in production systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong skill in Python and backend engineering.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working knowledge of C++ or a strong reason to be effective in performance-critical code.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience with data-intensive systems, distributed systems, parallel processing, or efficient data pipelines.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Exposure to ML, ML infrastructure, signal processing, real-time systems, computer vision, or related applied technical areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;A track record of shipping reliable software, not only prototypes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong debugging skills and the ability to find the root cause of complex system behavior.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Clear communication and good judgment when tradeoffs are not simple.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curiosity, adaptability, and the desire to learn new technical areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have — and what would make you exceptional:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with computer vision, depth cameras, pose estimation, tracking, or 3D data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML model deployment, feature pipelines, evaluation systems, or data quality tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming data, event systems, real-time processing, or low-latency applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with numerical methods, signal processing, filtering, state estimation, or robotics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOUR SUCCESS WILL LOOK LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months time, you understand the main systems, ship reliable changes, and help improve a meaningful data or product workflow. You give valuable technical input towards solving problems across backend, data, and perception systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 12 months time, you have made a measurable impact on system reliability, product capability, or data quality. You own important parts of the architecture and help the team make better technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We promise you’ll work with some of the most ambitious,&amp;nbsp; intelligent people in an exciting industry, and do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to engage in constructive, open, and honest communication to make Catapult extraordinary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in a collaborative yet challenging environment to consistently improve our performance, which in turn impacts our customers&#39; performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to work with people from multiple nationalities and cultures, and to build your global awareness.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to improve.&amp;nbsp; There is an unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams and athletes on the planet!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research shows that while men apply for jobs when they meet an average of 60% of the criteria, women and other marginalized groups tend only to apply when they check every box. So if you have what it takes, but don&#39;t meet every single point in our job ad, please still get in touch! We would love to have a chat and see if you could be a great addition to our team. We are building the future of sports performance. Our priority is to find the brightest talent who can add to our team culture, actively contribute, and be excited about what they do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All offers of employment are subject to Catapult&#39;s positive prehire check. To find out more, please contact the Talent Partner for this role.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Policy Manager, you will be responsible for driving the creation and implementation of policies for all upcoming categories across our product organisation and supporting functions. You will collaborate with key stakeholders, including legal, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, and transactional product teams, to develop policies that balance business objectives, user experience, compliance, and operational feasibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work closely with product, customer support, operations, and moderation teams to ensure policies are designed, approved, and implemented effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong strategic thinking, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills to establish processes that streamline collaboration and ensure policies are rolled out in a timely manner. You will play a key role in shaping the framework that enables Vinted’s expansion while maintaining a fair, safe, and seamless experience for our members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders to develop policies for new and existing categories, incorporating input from legal teams on compliance, Trust &amp;amp; Safety teams on online moderation, and transactional product teams on post-order policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance key considerations such as business objectives, operational costs, user experience, and legal requirements to create fair and effective policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine processes that enhance collaboration between product, customer support, operations, and moderation teams, ensuring policies are rolled out efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve policies based on real-world impact, member feedback, and evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience as a Policy Manager in digital marketplaces, eCommerce platforms, or other fast-paced, consumer-facing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in dynamic, early-stage settings and isn’t afraid to dive into complex challenges to drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a demonstrated ability to think both strategically and tactically, with strong risk-based judgment in fast-changing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excels at project and stakeholder management, bringing teams together to create and implement effective policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is autonomous and a proactive, practical learner who thrives with ambiguity and prioritises what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses data and analytical skills to make informed, strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pays close attention to detail and communicates with clarity and precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€81.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€110.400 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted’s &lt;strong&gt;Marketing domain&lt;/strong&gt; is growing - we’re on a mission to make Vinted known and loved as the go-to destination for everything second-hand. Marketing is one of the primary drivers behind our biggest strategic goals, from &lt;strong&gt;winning the USA market&lt;/strong&gt; to expanding beyond fashion into a &lt;strong&gt;multi-vertical platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Data Science and Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; team to hands-on build, refine, and scale our core predictive and explanatory models. In this role, you will be the technical engine behind our Bayesian Media Mix Models (MMM), user value machine learning models, and advanced statistical frameworks. Your focus will be on engineering robust, high-performing models that transform complex data into the precise insights our domain relies on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve Our Marketing Measurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Code, calibrate, and scale our Bayesian Media Mix Models (MMM) and ROI frameworks to unlock precise business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Deploy Core Models:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain sophisticated econometric and statistical models (MMM, GMV, engagement) to quantify marketing impact and guide multi-channel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate Model Validation &amp;amp; Health Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Design automated frameworks and reliability metrics that continuously monitor model health and ensure long-term accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Next-Gen, Automated Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the ambition toward intelligent data products [such as self-healing MMMs] using modern AI and automation to optimize model runtimes and scale our ecosystem as Vinted grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Decision Scientists &amp;amp; Marketing Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the core technical partner, translating complex mechanics into clear concepts and helping the team connect model outputs to robust business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Modelling Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a high bar for code quality, rigorous validation, and reproducibility to ensure our data science practices remain clean and trusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Data Science Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience focused on advanced statistical, econometric, or time-series modelling (experience in marketing measurement/MMM is an advantage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Theoretical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundation in advanced statistics, causal inference, and regression. Familiarity with probabilistic programming (e.g., PyMC) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research-to-Application Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to read scientific papers, explore state-of-the-art techniques, and replicate or adapt advanced methodologies to solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production-Grade Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly proficient in Python, with a passion for building models as data products. You design your pipelines and code so they are modular, reproducible, and easily used or extended by other scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Minded Tech Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; You care deeply about the why behind your code, naturally connecting technical model outputs to commercial metrics and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Background:&lt;/strong&gt; A Master’s or PhD degree in a highly quantitative discipline (Statistics, Econometrics, Mathematics, Data Science, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful storyteller:&lt;/strong&gt; A charismatic and confident presenter who navigates any topic’s technicality, actively driving and facilitating strategic business conversations across both technical and leadership audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
